---
/**
 * Where the reward model is right, where it is wrong, and the correlation that flips sign.
 *
 * Every number is from `checkpoints/rm-seed1-.../run.json`: accuracy by centipawn band over the
 * 1 268 held-out pairs, plus the two correlations between the learned margin and the engine's gap.
 *
 * The bars are the diagnosis. Accuracy peaks in the 400-800 band and collapses in the mate band,
 * which is a third of the pairs -- a mate is a tactical fact and a static read of the resulting
 * position cannot see it. That is exactly the band a verifiable reward answers without error,
 * which is the bridge from the second half of the lesson to the third.
 *
 * The 800-2000 bar is drawn hollow because it holds ten pairs. Across four seeds it reported 90 %,
 * 68 %, 90 % and 50 %: the same absence of data wearing four faces. Drawing it solid would invite
 * exactly the reading the milestone spent a ledger entry refusing.
 *
 * The two numbers underneath are the same correlation over two populations: -0.128 with the mate
 * pairs and +0.058 without them. One correlation over two regimes describes neither.
 */
interface Band {
  label: string;
  pairs: number;
  accuracy: number;
}

const bands: Band[] = [
  { label: '100-200', pairs: 556, accuracy: 0.7752 },
  { label: '200-400', pairs: 242, accuracy: 0.7479 },
  { label: '400-800', pairs: 104, accuracy: 0.8077 },
  { label: '800-2000', pairs: 10, accuracy: 0.9 },
  { label: 'mate', pairs: 356, accuracy: 0.6826 },
];

const FLOOR = 0.5;
const TOP = 0.9;
const height = (accuracy: number) => ((accuracy - FLOOR) / (TOP - FLOOR)) * 120;
const x = (index: number) => 80 + index * 106;
const thin = (band: Band) => band.pairs < 40;
---

<figure class="fig fig--bands">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 640 250"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Acierto del modelo de recompensa por banda de distancia en centipeones: 77,5 por ciento entre 100 y 200 con 556 pares, 74,8 entre 200 y 400 con 242, 80,8 entre 400 y 800 con 104, un 90 por ciento entre 800 y 2000 que se dibuja hueco porque solo tiene diez pares, y 68,3 por ciento en la banda de mate con 356 pares. La banda de mate es la peor y es un tercio de los datos."
  >
    <g font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--muted)">
      <line x1="60" y1="170" x2="620" y2="170" stroke="var(--line)" stroke-width="0.8"></line>
      <line
        x1="60"
        y1={170 - height(0.75)}
        x2="620"
        y2={170 - height(0.75)}
        stroke="var(--line)"
        stroke-width="0.6"
        stroke-dasharray="3 3"
      ></line>
      <text x="16" y={170 - height(0.75) + 3} font-size="9">
        75 %
      </text>
      <text x="16" y="173" font-size="9">
        50 %
      </text>

      {bands.map((band, index) => (
        <g>
          <rect
            x={x(index)}
            y={170 - height(band.accuracy)}
            width="62"
            height={height(band.accuracy)}
            rx="2"
            fill={band.label === 'mate' ? 'var(--diagram-stroke)' : 'var(--accent)'}
            fill-opacity={thin(band) ? '0.06' : band.label === 'mate' ? '0.2' : '0.3'}
            stroke={band.label === 'mate' ? 'var(--line)' : 'var(--accent)'}
            stroke-width="0.9"
            stroke-dasharray={thin(band) ? '3 3' : undefined}
          />
          <text
            x={x(index) + 31}
            y={170 - height(band.accuracy) - 8}
            text-anchor="middle"
            font-size="10"
            fill={band.label === 'mate' ? 'var(--ink)' : 'var(--accent-text-aa)'}
          >
            {(band.accuracy * 100).toFixed(1)}
          </text>
          <text x={x(index) + 31} y="186" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9">
            {band.label}
          </text>
          <text x={x(index) + 31} y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-size="9">
            {band.pairs} pares
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}

      <text x="80" y="222" font-size="9">
        la barra hueca tiene diez pares: en cuatro semillas dio 90, 68, 90 y 50 %
      </text>
      <text x="80" y="238" font-size="9" fill="var(--accent-text-aa)">
        margen frente a distancia: Pearson −0,128 con los mates, +0,058 sin ellos
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="caption">
    El acierto se desploma justo en la banda de mate, que es un tercio de los pares y lo único que
    una recompensa verificable contesta sin error. La correlación cambia de signo al quitarla.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
